/*!
    \page libkmahjongg-index.html
    \title LibKMahjongg

    libkmahjongg is a library used for loading and rendering of Mahjongg tilesets and associated backgrounds, 
    used by KMahjongg, KShisen, and Kajongg. Shared data is installed to {kdedir}/share/apps/kmahjongglib/*

    Contents:
    \list
      \li kmahjonggtileset.cpp/.h : implementation of the \l{KMahjonggTileset}{KMahjonggTileset} class
      \li kmahjonggbackground.cpp/.h: implementation of the \l{KMahjonggBackground}{KMahjonggBackground} class
      \li tilesets: Directory for svg files and .desktop data describing the metrics of tiles
      \li backgrounds: Art and .desktop description for backgrounds
    \endlist

    Questions? Contact Mauricio Piacentini <mauricio@tabuleiro.com>

    \section1 API Reference

    \list
        \li \l{LibKMahjongg Classes}
    \endlist
*/
